  "description": "Asha has spent her days working tirelessly as a public official in charge of maintaining peace and security on Earth. But one day, due to a malfunction in a warp machine, she ends up arriving on an unknown planet.\n\nThere, she meets a very attractive man named Hayakan, with whom she ends up setting off on a journey. However, he seems to possess a rather troublesome condition.\n\nBecause of that condition, Hayakan has been shunned and treated as a monster. But when Asha treats him like an ordinary person, he finds himself hopelessly drawn to her.\n\n“You are the only one who sees me as a person. Only by your side can I exist not as a monster, but as a human being.”\n\nTwo people, each carrying their own loneliness, become entangled in a fate filled with secrets. What awaits them once those secrets are finally unraveled?\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/212826)",
